      </div>
      <div class="projects-section">
        <h3>MUSIC VIDEOS</h3>
        <a href="/halfway-broken" data-video="halfwaybroken_hover.mp4">Halfway Broken by Luna Elle <span class="status">(2024)</span></a>
        <a href="#" data-video="offonanisland_hover.mp4">Off On An Island by Cooper <span class="status">(2023)</span></a>
